{
  "1": {
    "episodeId": 1,
    "title": "Stegosaurus",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013249",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Wow!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Look at those big plates on your back.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: Hello there! I'm a Stegosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "My name means roof lizard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Reporter: Why are you called a roof lizard?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: That name came from my back plates.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Scientists thought they were stacked like roof tiles.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Reporter: But your plates are not lying flat.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: Right. Now everyone knows they stand up tall.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "They look like big flags along my back.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Reporter: How big are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: I'm about nine meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "That's almost as long as a school bus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Reporter: Your tail has spikes!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: That's right.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "My sharp tail spikes scare away enemies.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Reporter: Do you eat meat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: Nope. I'm a peaceful plant eater.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "I love soft plants and leaves.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Reporter: What year is it now?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: We are 150 million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "This is the Jurassic period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Reporter: Tell me about your Jurassic neighbors.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: I have good neighbors like Brachiosauruses.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "And there are bad ones like Allosauruses.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Reporter: It was great meeting you, Stegosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Stegosaurus: It was fun talking to you, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Come visit again!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "2": {
    "episodeId": 2,
    "title": "Brachiosaurus",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013250",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Hey! Brachiosaurus! Hey, wait a second!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Ugh . . . ugh . . . Hello! I'm a reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Can I interview you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: Hello, there. I'm a Brachiosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "My name means arm lizard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Reporter: Arm lizard? That's a funny name!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: It is!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "My front legs, or arms, are very long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "They're longer than my back legs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Reporter: Are you heavier than an elephant?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: Of course. I weigh much more than one.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "I weigh as much as eight elephants!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Reporter: Wow! That's really heavy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Do you eat meat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: Nope! I'm a plant eater.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "I munch on leaves and twigs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Reporter: Your neck is really long!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "It's like a giraffe's.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: Yes, I can eat from the tallest trees.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Reporter: Who's taller: you or a giraffe?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: I'm more than twice as tall.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "I'm one of the biggest dinosaurs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Reporter: Wow! This is the Jurassic period, right?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: Yes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "We are 150 million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Reporter: What other dinosaurs do you live with?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: Apatosauruses and Stegosauruses are my friends.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Reporter: That's wild!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Thanks for chatting, Brachiosaurus!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Brachiosaurus: Anytime, little reporter. Come back soon!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "3": {
    "episodeId": 3,
    "title": "Tyrannosaurus",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013251",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: You look scary!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: I'm a Tyrannosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: You may call me Tyrannosaurus rex.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "That means tyrant lizard king.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Reporter: Are you the king of dinosaurs?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: Ha-ha! I got my name because of my size.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "I'm one of the biggest meat eaters ever!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Reporter: How big are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: I'm about 12 meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "That's longer than a school bus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Reporter: But your arms look really short.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: That's okay. I'm a fierce hunter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "And I don't need my arms to hunt.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Reporter: Your head is the size of a bathtub.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: Yes. My head is big.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "My big head holds my very big mouth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "My powerful bite can crush bones.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Reporter: How many teeth do you have?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: I have sixty teeth!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Some are longer than large bananas.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Reporter: Yikes. What year is it now?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: We are seventy million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "This is the Cretaceous period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: Ooh—I see my next meal!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Reporter: I hope it's not me.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Tyrannosaurus: You're too small, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "There's a yummy Triceratops.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "And an Edmontosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "It's time to hunt!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "4": {
    "episodeId": 4,
    "title": "Triceratops",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013252",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Whoa! Your horns are amazing.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Triceratops: Thank you. I'm a Triceratops.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "My name means three horned face.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Reporter: That name is perfect for you.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Triceratops: Yes. Look at the horns above my eyes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "They are one meter long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Reporter: What do you use your horns for?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Triceratops: I can use them to attack enemies.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Sometimes Triceratops fight each other too.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Reporter: Your head looks very fancy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Triceratops: Thanks! I love to show off my frill.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "I can use it to protect my neck.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Reporter: How big are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Triceratops: I'm nine meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "I'm almost as long as a school bus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Reporter: What do you eat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Triceratops: I eat plants that grow low.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "My teeth are good at slicing tough plants.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "I have eight hundred teeth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Reporter: That's a lot!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Triceratops: Yes, but you can't see them all.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "I am always growing new teeth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "New teeth grow under my old teeth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Reporter: Are we in the Cretaceous period?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Triceratops: That's right.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "We are seventy million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Triceratops: Oh! A Tyrannosaurus is coming.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Tyrannosauruses aren't friendly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Reporter: Be careful!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Triceratops: Don't worry. I can fight back.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Good-bye, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "5": {
    "episodeId": 5,
    "title": "Ankylosaurus",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013253",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Whoa! You look like a tank!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: I'm not a tank! I'm an Ankylosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "My name means stiff lizard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Reporter: How did you get that name?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: Some of my bones are joined together tightly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "This makes my body stiff and strong.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Reporter: What are those things on your back?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: They are hard, bony plates.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "This armor protects my back and neck.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Reporter: You have a club on your tail.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: Yes. My tail club is a powerful weapon.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "I can break enemies’ bones with one swing!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Reporter: Why do you need a weapon like that?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: I move slowly, and my brain is small.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "I'm an easy target for enemies like Tyrannosauruses.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "But they can't eat me easily!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Reporter: Oh! You live with Tyrannosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: Yes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "We are seventy million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "This is the Cretaceous period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Reporter: How heavy are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: I weigh more than an elephant.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "I eat as much as one too.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Reporter: What do you eat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: I eat plants that grow low.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "I can't lift my head very high.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Reporter: Do you—",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: Sorry. I'm going to a fern patch.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "I walk slowly, so I'd better go now.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Reporter: Bye, Ankylosaurus!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Ankylosaurus: Good-bye, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "6": {
    "episodeId": 6,
    "title": "Iguanodon",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013254",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Hello! Who are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Iguanodon: I'm an Iguanodon.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Reporter: Are you an iguana?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Iguanodon: Ha-ha! No way.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "But my teeth look like iguanas' teeth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "That's how I got my name.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Reporter: You're much bigger than an iguana!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Iguanodon: Yep.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "I'm almost as long as a school bus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "My body is nine meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Reporter: I don't see your teeth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Iguanodon: They're in the back of my mouth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "I don't have any front teeth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "So I use my beak to tear plants.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Reporter: Your hands look cool.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Iguanodon: Thanks. I have long fingers that bend.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "They help me grab things.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "And my thumbs are sharp spikes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Reporter: What do you use the spikes for?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Iguanodon: I use them as a weapon.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "I can also break open seeds with them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Reporter: Do you walk on two legs?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Iguanodon: I usually walk on four legs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "But I can also walk on two.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Reporter: Is this the Cretaceous period?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Iguanodon: Yes, it is.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "We are 125 million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Reporter: Whoa! That's a long time ago.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Iguanodon: You're right.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "I live way before Tyrannosauruses and Triceratops.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Reporter: Thanks for talking with me, Iguanodon.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Iguanodon: Any time, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "7": {
    "episodeId": 7,
    "title": "Velociraptor",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013255",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Hmm.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "I don't see any dinosaurs in this desert.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Velociraptor: Hey! Down here!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "I'm a Velociraptor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Reporter: Oh, hello, little guy!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Does your name mean short dinosaur?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Velociraptor: No! My name means fast robber.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Reporter: Why are you called a fast robber?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Velociraptor: I can run about forty kilometers per hour.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "That helps me grab food fast.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Reporter: Ooh! What do you eat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Velociraptor: I'm a meat eater.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "I have a long claw on each foot.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "I use them like knives when I hunt.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Reporter: Can you fly?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Velociraptor: I have long feathers on my arms.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "So my arms look like wings.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "But I can't fly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Reporter: Your tail is really long!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Velociraptor: It helps me balance when I move fast.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Reporter: How big are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Velociraptor: I'm two meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "I weigh as much as a medium dog.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Reporter: What period is this?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Velociraptor: This is the Cretaceous period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "We are 75 million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Reporter: Do other dinosaurs live here?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Velociraptor: Yes. Oviraptors live here.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "And so do yummy Protoceratops.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Oh. There's one now! Bye!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Reporter: Wow! You are fast! Good-bye!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Velociraptor: See you next time, little reporter!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "8": {
    "episodeId": 8,
    "title": "Pteranodon the Pterosaur",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013256",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: What kind of dinosaur are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Pteranodon: I'm not a dinosaur!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "I'm a pterosaur—a flying reptile.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Reporter: Oh!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Well, then, what kind of pterosaur are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Pteranodon: I'm a Pteranodon.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "My name means winged and toothless.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Reporter: Are you a good flier?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Pteranodon: Of course! I have light, hollow bones.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "And my wings stretch seven meters wide.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Reporter: That's really wide!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Pteranodon: I use them to push off the ground.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Then I flap them to fly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Reporter: Do you spend all your time flying?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Pteranodon: No. I like to float in water.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "That's where I find my food.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Reporter: Oh. What do you eat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Pteranodon: I catch fish with my beak.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Then I swallow them whole.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "But I have to watch out for enemies.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Reporter: Who are your enemies?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Pteranodon: Water reptiles, sharks, and dinosaurs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "I have enemies on both land and water!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Reporter: What year is it now?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Pteranodon: I live 88 million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "This is the Cretaceous period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Reporter: You live at the same time as dinosaurs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Pteranodon: Yes. But don't call us dinosaurs, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Reporter: I know that now! Thanks, Pteranodon!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Pteranodon: I'll be off now. Good-bye!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "9": {
    "episodeId": 9,
    "title": "Spinosaurus",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013257",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: You're really big!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: I'm a Spinosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "My name means spine lizard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Reporter: Your spines are tall.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: That's right. Some are almost two meters tall.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "They hold up my sail.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Reporter: What is your sail for?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: Scientists think I use it to show off.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Some think it controls my body heat.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Reporter: Hmm. Are those things true?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: I'll never tell!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "It's my spiny secret.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Reporter: Do you live near water?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: Yes. I like to stay near the water.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "My favorite food is fish.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Reporter: Oh. How do you catch fish?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: I have jaws like a crocodile.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "I snap them fast to catch food.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Reporter: How big are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: I am 14 meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "I am one of the biggest meat eaters.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "I am longer than a Tyrannosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Reporter: Do you live with Tyrannosauruses?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: No. I live a long time before Tyrannosauruses.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Reporter: What year are we in?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: We're one hundred million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "This is the Cretaceous period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Spinosaurus: I'm going to splash in the river now.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Good-bye, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Reporter: Good-bye, Spinosaurus!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "10": {
    "episodeId": 10,
    "title": "Maiasaura",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013258",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Aww! Those babies are cute.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Are you their mother?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Maiasaura: Yes. I am a Maiasaura.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "That means good mother lizard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Reporter: Why are you called a good mother?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Maiasaura: My babies cannot walk or find food.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "So I must take good care of them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Many other dinosaurs don't do this.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Reporter: There are so many Maiasaura here!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Maiasaura: Yes. Our herd has hundreds of dinosaurs!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "This large group keeps us safe from enemies.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Reporter: Who are your enemies?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Maiasaura: Other dinosaurs sometimes attack us.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "They try to eat our babies.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Reporter: What do you eat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Maiasaura: I am a plant eater.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Reporter: Is that pile of plants your next meal?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Maiasaura: No. That's another Maiasaura's nest.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "We cover our eggs with old plants.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "This keeps our eggs warm.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Reporter: How big are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Maiasaura: I weigh as much as a hippo.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "And I am nine meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Reporter: How many legs do you walk on?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Maiasaura: I mainly walk on four legs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Young Maiasaura walk on two legs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Reporter: What year is it now?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Maiasaura: We are eighty million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "This is the Cretaceous period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Maiasaura: I must feed my babies now.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Good-bye, little reporter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Reporter: Good-bye, Maiasaura.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "11": {
    "episodeId": 11,
    "title": "Elasmosaurus the Plesiosaur",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013259",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Ahh! You scared me!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: Hello, I'm an Elasmosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Reporter: Wait. Are you a dinosaur?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: Nope. I'm a plesiosaur.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Plesiosaurs are reptiles that live in water.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Reporter: Your neck is so long!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: I'm ten meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "My neck is over half of my length.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "And it has 72 bones.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Reporter: How do you use your neck?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: It helps me breathe when I swim.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "And it helps me look for food.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Can I have that rock you're holding?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Reporter: Sure . . . Um, why did you swallow it?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: My teeth aren't good for chewing.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "So I have to swallow food whole.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Rocks help grind food in my stomach.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Reporter: Oh. What do you eat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: I eat fish and mollusks.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Reporter: What other creatures live here in the water?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: There are sharks, rays, turtles, and shellfish.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Other plesiosaurs live here too.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Reporter: Your flippers look like a sea turtle's.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Can you go on land?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: No. I can't use my flippers on land.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Reporter: What year is it?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: We are eighty million years before your time.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "This is the Cretaceous period.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Uh-oh! I see a shark.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Reporter: Yikes! It's time to go.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Elasmosaurus: Good-bye, little reporter. Thanks for the rock!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Reporter: Good-bye, Elasmosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "12": {
    "episodeId": 12,
    "title": "Pachycephalosaurus",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013260",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Reporter: Whoa! What a cool head!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Who are you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Pachycephalosaurus: I am a Pachycephalosaurus.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "That means thick headed lizard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Reporter: Is that a helmet on your head?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Pachycephalosaurus: Well, it looks like a helmet.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "But it's really a thick, bony dome.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "It's the top part of my skull.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Reporter: You have some interesting knobs and spikes too.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Do you like to show off your head?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Pachycephalosaurus: Yes! My head shows I'm tough.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Reporter: I bet you're a good fighter!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Pachycephalosaurus: Yep. I fight other Pachycephalosaurus sometimes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "We use our heads to fight each other.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Reporter: Your legs look strong too.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Pachycephalosaurus: They are.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "They help me run fast.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Reporter: You're not very big.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Pachycephalosaurus: I'm four meters long.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "And I'm not very tall.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "So I eat food close to the ground.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Reporter: What do you eat?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Pachycephalosaurus: My teeth are good for eating plants.",
        "translation": ""
      },
